OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy at first, with
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain spreading southeast
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Then turning drier
OL,8,Fand brighter in the afternoon with
OL,9,Fjust a few light showers. Fresh winds
OL,10,Feasing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,13,Fevening with some sunny spells. Cloud
OL,14,Fand a few outbreaks of light rain then
OL,15,Fspread across from the west later in
OL,16,Fthe night.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,19,Fmorning. Turning more showery in the
OL,20,Fafternoon, some of showers on the
OL,21,Fheavy side.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
